01:43:01.458 --> 01:43:02.625
Gerald Brenan.

01:43:02.792 --> 01:43:04.875
Teman baik Virginia Woolf.

01:43:06.167 --> 01:43:09.209
Gerald menunjukkan beberapa dekade yang lalu

01:43:09.375 --> 01:43:14.250
