01:44:15.208 --> 01:44:16.541
Terima kasih banyak, Isabelle.

01:44:16.708 --> 01:44:19.166
Anehnya
bahwa Hispanis terhebat kami adalah,

01:44:19.333 --> 01:44:22.125
